s.\n\nPhysics drives everything, including forces such as wind, lightning, lasers, explosions and electricity, and chips let you give objects individual properties. The puzzles are built in 3D. Steam Workshop support allows players to make and share their own machines. It is single-player, and it suits tinkerers and puzzle fans who enjoy experimenting with cause and effect."}}